  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116548",
      "title": "Deferrable Views: Summary",
      "lectureOrder": 312,
      "videoOrder": 296,
      "sourceHash": "8d5cb3b6dcf4ea06bd552941a6707a29e98f313df1bd2371d26af737e106d899",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.69,
          "end": 2.37,
          "en": "And that's essentially it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.37,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "for deferrable views.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 7.74,
          "en": "As mentioned, there are some other things you can configure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.74,
          "end": 10.92,
          "en": "For example, you could also add @loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.92,
          "end": 13.08,
          "en": "to add some loading fallback,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.08,
          "end": 16.293,
          "en": "and even control when exactly that will be shown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.25,
          "end": 19.5,
          "en": "You can add an error fallback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.5,
          "end": 23.4,
          "en": "in case loading these resources goes wrong,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.4,
          "end": 25.26,
          "en": "so in case fetching the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.26,
          "end": 28.023,
          "en": "that belongs to this component somehow fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.89,
          "end": 32.76,
          "en": "And you can also configure these triggers in great detail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.76,
          "end": 34.86,
          "en": "and also combine multiple triggers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.86,
          "end": 37.44,
          "en": "with each other if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.44,
          "end": 41.61,
          "en": "But chances are high that you'll typically use @defer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.61,
          "end": 46.02,
          "en": "with a relatively basic setup where you might want to load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.02,
          "end": 49.65,
          "en": "and show some content once it scrolls into the viewport",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.65,
          "end": 52.35,
          "en": "or upon user interaction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.35,
          "end": 55.62,
          "en": "And you also might wanna consider prefetching the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.62,
          "end": 57.573,
          "en": "to load it even faster.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.41,
          "end": 61.62,
          "en": "And therefore defferable views implemented",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.62,
          "end": 64.2,
          "en": "with help of this defer template instruction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "can be very useful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 70.35,
          "en": "And this is a feature that's not meant to be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.35,
          "end": 73.77,
          "en": "instead of a route-based lazy-loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.77,
          "end": 77.64,
          "en": "but instead in addition to route-based lazy-loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.64,
          "end": 80.19,
          "en": "if it makes sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.19,
          "end": 83.97,
          "en": "Of course, just as with route-based lazy-loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.97,
          "end": 86.97,
          "en": "it does not make sense to use defer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.97,
          "end": 90.09,
          "en": "on content that will show up anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.09,
          "end": 94.65,
          "en": "Like here in my app component, this welcome component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.65,
          "end": 97.53,
          "en": "Since the app component is the first component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.53,
          "end": 99.72,
          "en": "to be rendered when the app starts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.72,
          "end": 102.42,
          "en": "this component here will always be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.42,
          "end": 103.83,
          "en": "when the app starts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.83,
          "end": 107.75999999999999,
          "en": "unless that's outside of the viewport or anything like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.75999999999999,
          "end": 111,
          "en": "or unless we really only wanna load it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111,
          "end": 113.31,
          "en": "once the user interacts with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 115.02000000000001,
          "en": "But outside of those cases,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.02000000000001,
          "end": 119.72999999999999,
          "en": "using defer here would probably not make too much sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.72999999999999,
          "end": 122.64,
          "en": "But there are situations where it can make sense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.64,
          "end": 125.013,
          "en": "like here with this offer-preview.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
